//
// Host-only: `herd_rows` is inert at its default, with the control that shows
// the comparison can see a change at all. Builds MLIR text only -- no device,
// no checkpoint, no toolchain beyond python and the air python bindings.
// One case reads the pre-parameter builder out of git, so it runs inside the
// work tree rather than from an installed copy.
//
// RUN: %PYTHON %S/test_herd_rows_inert.py | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: PASS  test_default_matches_the_pre_parameter_builder
// CHECK: PASS  test_omitting_herd_rows_matches_passing_one
// CHECK: PASS  test_two_rows_differs_by_gaining_a_herd_dimension
// CHECK: PASS  test_two_rows_differs_from_the_default
// CHECK: herd_rows inertness tests: 4/4 passed
